<properties>
{"title":"EODs & Forms SOP"}
</properties>
<content>
<callout icon="✅" color="green_bg">
	All six forms are **LIVE** — fill them every time. This is how we track performance, commissions, and pipeline. (Bookmark the ones for your role.)<br><br>**TIMING STANDARDS:** BOD before your first dial/DM. EODs by 9 PM EST sharp — same day, every day. Set times, set standards.
</callout>
## 🌅 Sales Rep BOD Form — fill BEFORE your first dial/DM (EVERYONE)
👉 [**The Vault — Sales Rep BOD Form**](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdpDpmns3tzjeKggQx4BjUedM5UWw2J4KS70nVDJkuQxssI7A/viewform)
Takes 60 seconds. Report: how you're feeling (1–5, be honest — a low score gets you a call because we actually care) · morning routine done? · your ONE non-negotiable today · the skill you're sharpening (pull it from yesterday's EOD). Patterns show up in BODs before they show up in your numbers.
---
## 📊 Setter EOD Form — fill at the end of every shift
👉 [**The Vault — Setter EOD Form**](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1QRqpF-F6OHlpLEtpaKwOBoPN8QRk8ZvZjCuNrSZlhEQ/viewform)
Report: total leads contacted · triage calls completed · calls booked today · any high-priority leads · blockers or issues · what you're going to do tomorrow to CRUSH (tomorrow's BOD asks about this).
---
## 📱 DM Setter EOD Form — fill at the end of every single day you work the DMs
👉 [**The Vault — DM Setter EOD Form**](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScGVX1WiFCmv9u60_n4IPPTcaoUEi3b3o4U7AEWqSe0Owxlyw/viewform)
Report: calls pitched and booked · calls on calendar for TODAY · calls showed · deals closed · cash collected and revenue generated (no "\$" or ",") · no-shows successfully rebooked · notes (lead quality issues, blockers) · what you're going to do tomorrow to CRUSH (tomorrow's BOD asks about this).
---
## 📊 Closer EOD Form — fill at the end of every shift
👉 [**The Vault — Closer EOD Form**](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1VmLLKCtCi1LfHdzFWqpAX_TwkjL93eJKh8wv4prtl8g/viewform)
Report: calls taken · closes · no-closes (with reasons) · revenue collected · top objection today · what you're going to do tomorrow to CRUSH (tomorrow's BOD asks about this).
<callout icon="💡" color="gray_bg">
	**Cash collected ≠ revenue generated.** Cash = what actually hit today. Revenue = total contract value. Report both.
</callout>
---
## 📝 Closer Post-Call Notes / EOC Form — fill after EVERY call
👉 [**The Vault — EOC Report Form**](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1QV9DqN68L1QozjXfORZFZA5goUeLnoVopZKJa_behR0/viewform)
Immediately after every single call — closed or not, do NOT wait until end of day. Lead email · outcome (Closed / No-Close / No-Show) · main objections · where they are in their decision · follow-up plan. Also paste the full notes into the lead's record in Close CRM.
---
## 🤝 New Deal / New Sale Form — fill on EVERY close
👉 [**The Vault — New Deal Log**](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1o95YYsSVHnpLC3EHPMDsuU4R-oUZpHolWb7HbHKMgyk/viewform)
The moment you close a sale, log it here — this is what drives commissions and the deal tracker. Fill: **Date Closed** · Client name / email / phone · Agreement signed? · Closer + Setter · Type of Call · Type of Sale · **Program Sold (Premium / Black / Accelerator)** · Cash Collected · Revenue Generated · Processor · Notes.
<callout icon="🚨" color="red_bg">
	Log the deal the SAME day it closes. This form feeds the commission math — if it's not logged, it doesn't get paid out.
</callout>
</content>
